    <text><paragraph>Historical biography with true dates. These events are not part of the synthetic care timeline.</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Historical date</th><th>History</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>about 1984</td><td>Former smoker who quit about thirty years before the index visit</td><td>D (CLM-0003)</td></tr><tr><td>January 2014</td><td>Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, disclosed publicly in late January, with breathlessness that keeps him from walking distances</td><td>D (CLM-0003, CLM-0004)</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

