    <text><paragraph>Alert and engaged. At intake, stops for breath after about 100 meters on level ground (mMRC grade 3); CAT score 22; independent in self-care. After pulmonary rehabilitation, walks about 300 meters at his own pace before stopping (mMRC grade 2); CAT score 15 at three months and 14 at six months. [S]</paragraph></text>

